# Local/demo Caddy config — no Cloudflare, no public ACME. Caddy's internal CA
# issues a self-signed cert per host, so `<slug>.rookery.localhost` serves real
# HTTPS on :443 (curl with -k). Same label-driven routing as production, just a
# self-signed issuer instead of Let's Encrypt/DNS-01.
{
	local_certs
}
